egeleiden. In sommige gevallen opereer je alleen, in andere gevallen gesteund door een ervaren en gemotiveerd team — waaronder de AI Platform Consultant, die het business probleem, het functional design en de user journeys aanlevert als basis voor jouw technisch ontwerp.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Kerntaken:</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Je ontwerpt </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Dataverse</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">-modellen en de bijbehorende security-architectuur (tabellen, relaties, business </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">rules</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, rollen en rechten), inclusief de datagrondslag (</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">grounding</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">) waarop AI-</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">agents</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> veilig kunnen redeneren.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Je kiest en onderbouwt het juiste patroon per vraagstuk: app, portal, workflow of AI-agent, en ontwerpt de technische architectuur van </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Copilot</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> Studio-</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">agents</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> (topics, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">plugins</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, connectoren, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Azure</span> <span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">OpenAI</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">-integratie).</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Je bepaalt de ALM- en omgevingsstrategie (</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">dev</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">/test/acceptatie/productie, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">pipelines</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, release management), inclusief versiebeheer en promotie van AI-</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">agents</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> en hun kennisbronnen.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769